      "id": "bug-020",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-19T17:50:00.000Z",
      "error_message": "EmptyStockReconciliationItemsError / no-change SR lines pruned",
      "file": "easy_entry/easy_entry/doctype/ee_stock_count/ee_stock_count.py",
      "root_cause": "ERPNext Stock Reconciliation.validate() unconditionally calls remove_items_with_no_change(), which drops lines where counted_qty == system_qty and raises EmptyStockReconciliationItemsError on an empty SR. The original plan used a draft SR as the live counting session, so counted-but-unchanged lines would silently vanish on each save.",
      "fix": "Redesigned to a dedicated EE Stock Count / EE Stock Count Line DocType pair as the session store. The SR is built only at finish_session from lines where counted_qty != system_qty; build_reconciliation catches EmptyStockReconciliationItemsError and returns None.",
      "tags": [
        "erpnext",
        "stock-reconciliation",
        "architecture",
        "doctype"
      ],
